{
    "background_story": "Novalee, a talented young musician, had always found solace in her craft. But after a tragic accident left her hands severely injured, she was forced to confront the agony of losing the one thing that brought her joy. The pain was not just physical, but also emotional, as she struggled to come to terms with the possibility of never playing music again. As she underwent multiple surgeries and grueling therapy sessions, Novalee's world was filled with the agony of uncertainty. Despite the darkness, she found a way to channel her emotions into her music, writing hauntingly beautiful songs that captured the depths of her suffering. Through her art, Novalee transformed her agony into a powerful expression of resilience and hope, inspiring others to find strength in the face of adversity.",
